title: 주5_금_1교시_강의실_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
(It’s the last day of class before the final exams.)
(I see NaHyun’s back.)
{name()}: Hey, NaHyun.
NaHyun: {name()}.
(NaHyun waves at me.)
{name()}: I'm surprised you actually made it to an 8 AM on the last day.
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: Well, it is the last day.
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: Plus, it’s the last time I’ll see you in this classroom, so of course I had to come.
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
(NaHyun laughs.)
(...Does this mean I won't have any more chances to see her?)
{name()}: ...How’s the studying for finals going?
NaHyun: Hard to say. I think I really need to pay attention to today’s lecture.
{name()}: Yeah, me too.
<<choice 주5_금_1교시_강의실_양나현_긍정1_영문 "Yeah, I think I'll be taking one this time." 주5_금_1교시_강의실_양나현_부정1_영문 "No? Aren't summer sessions only for people who messed up?">>
NaHyun: By any chance... are you taking any summer sessions?
===

title: 주5_금_1교시_강의실_양나현_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Yeah, I think I'll be taking one this time.
<<change lvHyun +5>>
<<like 양나현>>
NaHyun: That's great. What are you taking?
{name()}: I'll probably be in the Java Programming Lab.
{name()}: Are you taking one too?
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: Uh... I'm kind of on the verge of having to retake a course.
NaHyun: I mean, I still have the final exam left, but...
{name()}: Wait, are you talking about this class?
<<show hyun_idle>>
(We chatted a bit about summer sessions.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주5_금_1교시_강의실_양나현_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: I don't do summer sessions.
{name()}: If you work hard during the regular semester, you don't have to waste money on those.
<<show hyun_neg2>>
<<change lvHyun -5>>
<<dislike 양나현>>
NaHyun: I guess that's true......
<<play 양나현_허>>
NaHyun: I might have to take one, though.
<<notice "You feel a pang of guilt.">>
<<change karma +1>>
(My words seemed to have hit NaHyun pretty hard.)
(We talked more about summer sessions, but I felt uneasy the whole time.)
<<end>>
===